Package: multisiteDGP
Title: Simulate Summary Data for Multisite Trials
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("JoonHo", "Lee", , "jlee296@ua.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-4019-8703"))
Description: Simulates the summary data of a multisite trial: one
    estimated effect and one standard error per site. The site effects
    come from one of six distributions (Gaussian, Student t, skew-normal,
    asymmetric Laplace, two-component Gaussian mixture, point mass with
    slab) or from a user-supplied function. The standard errors are
    derived from simulated site sizes or set directly, and can be
    correlated with the site effects. The package also provides
    diagnostics of the simulated data, preset designs, plots, and
    converters for 'metafor' and 'baggr'. The data-generating model
    follows Lee et al. (2025) <doi:10.3102/10769986241254286>. Supported
    by the Institute of Education Sciences through Grant R305D240078 to
    the University of Alabama.
